+++ b/changes/ticket41339_hsdir_reuse_counters
@@ -0,0 +1,8 @@
+  o Minor features (metrics port, relay):
+    - Count, on the MetricsPort, the anonymous onion service directory
+      requests an HSDir receives, the requests and circuits that repeat them
+      on one circuit, and those whose previous hop is not a known relay, as
+      tor_relay_dos_total{type="hsdir_request_total"|"hsdir_req_reused"|
+      "hsdir_circ_reused"|"hsdir_unknown_prev_hop"}. Stock clients and
+      services repeat none, and use an unknown previous hop only while our
+      consensus lags theirs. Part of ticket 41339.
